    87	--    =X/postgres}, gate run 18/08/2026). If `supabase_auth_admin` reaches an
    88	--    auth hook the same way, the PUBLIC revoke strands it and EVERY login
    89	--    breaks. Re-granting explicitly AFTER the revoke makes ordering
    90	--    irrelevant. Scoped to the two auth hooks only: supabase_auth_admin has no
    91	--    business executing prune_integration_history.
    92	--
    93	--    This block was present in 44c44368f, deleted without mention in e964ab9bf
    94	--    when the second DO block was repurposed for get_my_org_ids, and restored
    95	--    here after an independent review found three documents still asserting it
