   115	-- ── 6: RLS HELPERS — anon revoked, `authenticated` DELIBERATELY RETAINED.
   116	--
   117	-- Postgres checks function EXECUTE against the QUERYING role when it evaluates a
   118	-- row-level-security policy expression. SECURITY DEFINER on the callee does not
   119	-- exempt it. `public.organizations` carries orgs_all / orgs_select /
   120	-- service_orgs policies that are org-membership-scoped via get_my_org_ids()
